# --- circuits: obsolete single-party trusted-setup files ---
# pot12/pot14 were this project's own self-generated Powers of Tau phase-1
# ceremony, superseded by gap #4's fix: every circuit's phase-2 setup is now
# anchored to the real, public, multi-party Hermez Perpetual Powers of Tau
# ceremony (powersOfTau28_hez_final_14.ptau) instead. That real ceremony
# file IS committed (see circuits/build/README.md) since both its official
# public mirrors currently 404/403 — losing this copy would make the setup
# unreproducible. These pot12/pot14 files are dead weight only.
circuits/build/pot12_*.ptau
circuits/build/pot14_*.ptau
